,"user":{"id":"2580739","name":"Torch","avatar":"14054b7d814664600b5bc5e7"},"text":"文采斐然！[emot=acfun,1805/]\n我们都是Acer，是在A站、在AC娘身边共同经历了18年时光的伙伴。我们是因为这里互相结识，因为这里收获快乐和感动的。“曾经拥有的热烈，决不会被忘却”，也许数据会消失，ID会被淡忘，但这份共同的经历是真实的，是无法磨灭的。只要一听到熟悉的歌声，一看到包子头，就会想起你，就会想起那些一起欢度的岁月。\n生日快乐🎂🎂🎂🎂🎂🎂🎂🎂🎂🎂\n感谢繁杂互联网世界中有你陪伴，让我可以借助这份温暖的光明看清航线，徜徉于赛博之海！","time":1749979273620,"floor":16,"likes":67,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":true}},"803332225":{"pages":["comments/4588330/threads/803332225/1.json"],"savedReplies":1,"reportedReplies":1,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"803332225","root":"803332225","user":{"id":"17062172","name":"樱桃在不在","avatar":"48a46f6e68c25c08a9a87f31"},"text":"我的宝闪闪发光！！","time":1749986472519,"floor":61,"likes":7,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":false}},"803331074":{"pages":["comments/4588330/threads/803331074/1.json"],"savedReplies":1,"reportedReplies":1,"rootMissing":false,"root":{"id":"803331074","root":"803331074","user":{"id":"66975","name":"小龟-R","avatar":"b7973d24b64987613a266ef6"},"text":"虽然很感动，但是我已经是看到小作文就害怕的惊弓之鸟了[emot=acfun,2759/]","time":1749979407148,"floor":18,"likes":8,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":1,"hot":false}}},"hotCount":1}